### Test 1: Registro exitoso
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro Martínez",
  "passport_number": "7777777777",
  "password": "test123456",
  "email": "pedro@example.com"
}

### Test 2: Datos incompletos (debe fallar con 400)
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### Test 3: Contraseña muy corta (debe fallar con 417)
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "passport_number": "8888888888",
  "password": "123",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Test 4: Email inválido (debe fallar con 417)
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "passport_number": "9999999999",
  "password": "test123456",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}
